 Your breath finds a steady rhythm, in-out, balanced like scales.  

These cards are now yours. They hum in your memory.  

The void peels away like wet parchment.  
 You smell woodsmoke first, then ale.  
 The Broken Lantern Inn snaps into place around you—low beams, a cracked hearth, midday light leaking through warped shutters.

